# 🚨 THE PAYMENT STORE. Written at runtime by server/vk-payments.js and it holds
# vk_user_id values alongside what each of them bought — personal data plus a
# purchase ledger. It must never reach a public repository, and it must never be
# what a deploy overwrites.
